report_lines.append(f"| 5 | **UACI (16-bit, $MAX=65535$)** | {summary['uaci_16_diag']['min']:.4f}% | {summary['uaci_16_diag']['max']:.4f}% | **{summary['uaci_16_diag']['mean']:.4f} ± {summary['uaci_16_diag']['std']:.4f}%** | Rata-rata perubahan intensitas mendekati nol |")
report_lines.append(f"| | *UACI (12-bit, $MAX=4095$)* | {summary['uaci_stored_diag']['min']:.4f}% | {summary['uaci_stored_diag']['max']:.4f}% | **{summary['uaci_stored_diag']['mean']:.4f} ± {summary['uaci_stored_diag']['std']:.4f}%** | Pergeseran magnitudo rata-rata sangat mikroskopis |")
report_lines.append(f"| 6 | **Entropi Citra Asli** | {summary['ent_orig']['min']:.4f} bit | {summary['ent_orig']['max']:.4f} bit | **{summary['ent_orig']['mean']:.4f} ± {summary['ent_orig']['std']:.4f} bit** | Sebaran informasi alami jaringan otak pada citra MRI |")
